# ---- Downloaded source data ------------------------------------------
# Everything under data/raw/ is a third-party download (~218 MB): the BLS
# table, the O*NET bundle, the SSA baby-name archive, the full livecareer
# resume CSV. All of it is re-downloadable -- data/PROVENANCE.md gives the
# exact URL and command for every file -- so it is not tracked.
data/raw/

# Derived from data/raw/ by data/build_*.py, and large. Rebuild with:
#   venv/bin/python data/build_resumes_csv.py
data/resumes/*.csv

# ---- NOT ignored, on purpose -----------------------------------------
# results/*_full_raw.json (~72 MB) IS tracked. Those files are the scored
# output of paid commercial re-ranker APIs; they cannot be regenerated
# without spending money again, and no single file exceeds GitHub's 50 MB
# warning threshold. Do not add them here. If the repo has to slim down,
# attach them to a release (or `tar -czf results_raw.tgz results/*_full_raw.json`)
# BEFORE ignoring them.

# ---- Misc -------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
.env
.venv/

# ---- Local agent/editor state (CONTAINS CREDENTIALS) ------------------
# .claude/settings.local.json holds an approved-command list that has, in
# this project, embedded a live Google API key and a GCP project id.
# Never track it.
.claude/
.idea/

